1
00:00:07,940 --> 00:00:09,980
Are you all right?

2
00:00:13,160 --> 00:00:14,900
You can see me?

3
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:15,600
Eh?

4
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:17,900
Never mind.

5
00:00:18,580 --> 00:00:21,660
Did something sad happen?

6
00:00:23,080 --> 00:00:25,500
Because...

7
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:27,090
You're crying.

8
00:00:27,090 --> 00:00:28,040
Oh, you're right.

9
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:31,040
You're weird.

10
00:00:31,040 --> 00:00:32,420
I'm not weird.

11
00:00:32,420 --> 00:00:35,300
Sorry, did I make you mad?

12
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:37,740
No, I'm happy.

13
00:00:37,740 --> 00:00:40,090
I've always been alone.

14
00:00:40,850 --> 00:00:42,270
So you're also alone.

15
00:00:42,850 --> 00:00:44,020
You too?

16
00:00:44,020 --> 00:00:47,860
Yeah, I just can't seem to make friends.

17
00:00:48,650 --> 00:00:50,070
I guess we're the same.

18
00:00:50,070 --> 00:00:50,980
The same?

19
00:00:51,430 --> 00:00:52,440
Yeah.

20
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:56,450
Then, will you stay together with me?

21
00:00:56,800 --> 00:00:59,740
Yeah. Let's be friends!

22
00:01:01,710 --> 00:01:02,750
Okay.

23
00:01:05,570 --> 00:01:07,280
It's all right.

24
00:01:09,210 --> 00:01:10,380
It won't hurt.

25
00:01:19,680 --> 00:01:22,180
I love you, Taito.

26
00:01:34,950 --> 00:01:36,690
I'm alive?

27
00:01:36,690 --> 00:01:38,880
What happened?

28
00:01:38,880 --> 00:01:41,080
So you're the rumored Saitohimea?

29
00:01:42,830 --> 00:01:45,900
Nice to meet you. I'm Hinata.

30
00:01:45,900 --> 00:01:47,870
Were you sent from the Church?

31
00:01:47,870 --> 00:01:50,210
Give me a break already!

32
00:01:50,210 --> 00:01:53,950
I'm not with Bahlskra anymore.

33
00:01:53,950 --> 00:01:56,870
I'm not going to remove his seal.

34
00:01:56,870 --> 00:01:57,880
So please...

35
00:01:57,880 --> 00:02:00,750
The Church? What's that?

36
00:02:02,640 --> 00:02:04,430
A monster!

37
00:02:04,670 --> 00:02:10,560
So that's how it is. You're just another demon worshipper.

38
00:02:19,410 --> 00:02:20,410
Stop it!

39
00:02:22,330 --> 00:02:23,160
Taito!

40
00:02:28,730 --> 00:02:30,160
Oh?

41
00:02:30,420 --> 00:02:33,830
Let Himea go!

42
00:02:37,290 --> 00:02:39,220
He doesn't even die from that, huh?

43
00:02:39,220 --> 00:02:40,470
Saitohimea.

44
00:02:41,330 --> 00:02:43,630
What kind of power did you give him?

45
00:02:43,630 --> 00:02:45,140
Like I'd tell you!

46
00:02:45,810 --> 00:02:48,680
Hmm... Well, it doesn't matter.

47
00:02:54,030 --> 00:02:56,900
Damn it... Damn it, damn it!

48
00:02:57,410 --> 00:03:02,210
Damn it! Why can't I save her?!

49
00:03:03,240 --> 00:03:06,290
Heh, I've killed him six times already and he still won't die.

50
00:03:06,290 --> 00:03:07,780
Taito...

51
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:11,420
Stop it! I beg you!

52
00:03:12,170 --> 00:03:15,750
Oh? So he'll stop reviving?

53
00:03:15,750 --> 00:03:19,040
I guess there's a limit to the number of times he'll be able to do that.

54
00:03:19,040 --> 00:03:23,670
So that would mean he won't come back to life if he dies a seventh time, wouldn't it?

55
00:03:24,640 --> 00:03:26,140
You shouldn't hide stuff like that.

56
00:03:27,850 --> 00:03:31,260
It will reset every fifteen minutes.

57
00:03:33,320 --> 00:03:36,560
And then he can die another six times, huh?

58
00:03:37,990 --> 00:03:41,980
That's how the curse I placed on Taito works.

59
00:03:44,790 --> 00:03:46,280
You've fallen for him, huh?

60
00:03:48,290 --> 00:03:50,780
So you foolishly granted him a power

61
00:03:50,780 --> 00:03:53,810
that prevents him from dying,

62
00:03:53,810 --> 00:03:56,410
just so he could stay by your side forever.

63
00:03:57,130 --> 00:03:59,300
Is that true, Himea?

64
00:04:00,590 --> 00:04:02,610
Please stop it.

65
00:04:02,610 --> 00:04:05,040
I'll do as you say.

66
00:04:05,350 --> 00:04:08,810
