202
00:09:32,050 --> 00:09:33,670
It's not for your sake.

203
00:09:33,670 --> 00:09:36,430
I just don't need this sword to take care of this trash.

204
00:09:36,430 --> 00:09:38,300
You can just die.

205
00:09:38,300 --> 00:09:39,960
