206
00:09:40,730 --> 00:09:44,430
I'm suddenly in a really good mood now.

207
00:09:44,820 --> 00:09:47,340
So maybe I should get a little serious.

208
00:09:51,530 --> 00:09:53,110
What is she?

209
00:09:53,110 --> 00:09:54,110
Roar!

210
00:09:55,150 --> 00:09:56,900
I'm a monster!

211
00:10:02,330 --> 00:10:04,360
Taito!

212
00:10:14,800 --> 00:10:18,130
Hey, how far am I going to fly?!

213
00:10:18,130 --> 00:10:19,550
There you are.

214
00:10:20,100 --> 00:10:22,510
Those are some serious jumping skills.

215
00:10:22,510 --> 00:10:26,260
Aww, can't you compliment me in some other way?

216
00:10:30,150 --> 00:10:34,480
If that's the best you've got after all this time, you can't be popular with the girls.

217
00:10:34,900 --> 00:10:37,110
Actually, I'm not.

218
00:10:37,110 --> 00:10:39,640
So you're not?

219
00:10:40,120 --> 00:10:43,280
But to me you're popular, so it's okay.

220
00:10:43,660 --> 00:10:45,540
I love you, Taito.

221
00:10:46,960 --> 00:10:48,540
I'll give you something nice.

222
00:10:48,850 --> 00:10:50,390
Something nice?

223
00:10:50,390 --> 00:10:52,250
Yes. Something nice.

224
00:10:54,170 --> 00:10:54,750
It's hot!

225
00:10:55,630 --> 00:10:57,470
Of course it is.

226
00:10:57,470 --> 00:11:00,880
It's a forbidden spell that even we Vampires can't use.

227
00:11:01,260 --> 00:11:05,520
The moment one uses it, it will consume the whole upper body.

228
00:11:05,520 --> 00:11:07,770
Then what if a human like me used it?

229
00:11:07,770 --> 00:11:10,180
I see. If it's my body...

230
00:11:10,180 --> 00:11:11,600
That's right.

231
00:11:11,600 --> 00:11:13,270
