Wait!

274
00:13:20,360 --> 00:13:21,940
Wait!

275
00:13:22,910 --> 00:13:24,720
I'm going!

276
00:13:24,720 --> 00:13:26,950
W-We should take this chance to run away, Taito!

277
00:13:27,740 --> 00:13:29,530
We can't win against him!

278
00:13:29,530 --> 00:13:30,200
He's too strong!

279
00:13:35,250 --> 00:13:36,820
Say, Himea.

280
00:13:38,090 --> 00:13:41,520
I know I kept you waiting for those nine years and all,

281
00:13:41,520 --> 00:13:44,560
but could you just wait another five minutes?

282
00:13:44,560 --> 00:13:45,420
Huh?

283
00:13:46,180 --> 00:13:50,000
I'll beat the crap out of him and be right back with you.

284
00:13:50,680 --> 00:13:52,050
Taito.

285
00:13:53,190 --> 00:13:57,090
Okay. I'll fight by your side.

286
00:13:58,820 --> 00:14:00,360
You don't have to force yourself.

287
00:14:01,740 --> 00:14:03,150
Don't be stupid.

288
00:14:03,150 --> 00:14:05,360
You can't win alone, Taito.

289
00:14:05,360 --> 00:14:06,660
Really?

290
00:14:06,660 --> 00:14:10,450
Yes. But we might have a chance if we work together.

291
00:14:10,450 --> 00:14:15,070
Over these nine years, you've grown so strong and cool...

292
00:14:15,540 --> 00:14:16,410
Yeah.

293
00:14:22,420 --> 00:14:27,010
I could have gone on with my normal life, since I'd forgrotten all about Himea.

294
00:14:27,010 --> 00:14:30,530
But, I didn't do nothing all the time.

295
00:14:30,530 --> 00:14:33,350
I was quite good at karate.

296
00:14:33,350 --> 00:14:36,880
I'm sure that was all for Himea's sake.

297
00:14:37,190 --> 00:14:40,900
So that I could protect her the next time we would meet.

298
00:14:41,300 --> 00:14:43,390
Shocky Shock attack!

299
00:14:53,400 --> 00:14:57,030
Oh, it seems like you did improve a little.

300
00:14:57,500 --> 00:14:59,790
Yeah, just a little.

301
00:14:59,790 --> 00:15:06,440
Just a little effort and I was suddenly a million steps ahead of you.

302
00:15:06,440 --> 00:15:08,380
It's over, Hinata.

303
00:15:09,720 --> 00:15:11,140
A million steps?

304
00:15:11,600 --> 00:15:14,890
You mean a million steps behind me, don't you?

305
00:15:23,810 --> 00:15:26,900
You shouldn't be so easily impressed by your meager power.

306
00:15:29,490 --> 00:15:31,440
Out of the way, idiot!

307
00:15:46,340 --> 00:15:49,090
A million steps ahead and yet you need four people to fight.

308
00:15:49,090 --> 00:15:51,130
As expected of you, Nii-san.

309
00:15:51,400 --> 00:15:53,090
Hey, Kurogane Taito.

310
00:15:53,090 --> 00:15:54,010
What?

311
00:15:54,010 --> 00:15:55,510
Help me out here.

312
00:15:55,510 --> 00:15:58,600
Oh? You finally decided to be honest with yourself?

313
00:15:58,600 --> 00:15:59,140
Yeah.

314
00:15:59,140 --> 00:16:03,640
But I'm not about to let someone who made fun of me get away.

315
00:16:07,820 --> 00:16:10,070
So, do you have a plan?

316
00:16:10,070 --> 00:16:12,900
Can you do that again?

317
00:16:15,200 --> 00:16:19,240
Then you go and get him. And then...

318
00:16:20,170 --> 00:16:23,620
You're already out of options. 
Let's put an end to this.

319
00:16:23,960 --> 00:16:27,080
Do I kill everyone except Saitohimea?

320
00:16:27,460 --> 00:16:33,860
Or would you rather hand her over to save your own lives?

321
00:16:33,860 --> 00:16:36,200
We decline both options!

322
00:16:36,200 --> 00:16:39,010
I'll beat the crap out of you and protect Himea!

323
00:16:39,850 --> 00:16:40,880
Is that so?

324
00:16:43,860 --> 00:16:44,730
Go!

325
00:16:47,030 --> 00:16:48,100
Taito!

326
00:17:29,570 --> 00:17:31,100
I did it...

327
00:17:36,070 --> 00:17:38,940
That power is quite troublesome.

328
00:17:38,940 --> 00:17:41,030
Did you get that from her?

329
00:17:41,500 --> 00:17:42,700
That's unfair.

330
00:17:42,700 --> 00:17:47,070
After all the torture I've put you through, you never gave me anything.

331
00:17:47,400 --> 00:17:50,540
Anyway, you seem to be the biggest for now.

332
00:17:59,520 --> 00:18:00,880
Six times...

333
00:18:02,700 --> 00:18:04,930
So the next time is the last.

334
00:18:06,700 --> 00:18:09,290
It's just like nine years ago, huh?

335
00:18:09,290 --> 00:18:11,740
You haven't progressed at all.

336
00:18:11,740 --> 00:18:13,110
Stop it already!

337
00:18:13,110 --> 00:18:16,190
Sure, if you want it that way.

338
00:18:16,530 --> 00:18:19,110
But this time you'll properly promise

339
00:18:19,450 --> 00:18:21,400
to become my slave.

340
00:18:21,910 --> 00:18:24,320
I'll be your slave or whatever else you want!

341
00:18:26,670 --> 00:18:27,780
Just don't hurt...

342
00:18:28,400 --> 00:18:29,330
Taito...

343
00:18:32,380 --> 00:18:33,540
Gekkou!

344
00:18:39,140 --> 00:18:41,090
Don't do it, Himea.

345
00:18:41,090 --> 00:18:45,130
You can't become his slave.

346
00:18:45,600 --> 00:18:49,190
It's okay. I'll protect you this time.

347
00:18:49,190 --> 00:18:50,600
Just wait there.

348
00:18:50,810 --> 00:18:54,110
I'll beat the crap out of him and return to your side.

349
00:18:54,820 --> 00:18:56,570
You'll protect her?

350
00:18:57,360 --> 00:18:59,190
In this situation?

351
00:19:00,450 --> 00:19:02,280
Hey, monster!

352
00:19:02,700 --> 00:19:03,530
Don't!

353
00:19:04,530 --> 00:19:07,660
Everything will be over if you die now.

354
00:19:09,500 --> 00:19:13,450
Himea gave me my life.

355
00:19:14,420 --> 00:19:16,960
So if it will save her...

356
00:19:17,500 --> 00:19:19,870
And make up for these nine years...

357
00:19:19,870 --> 00:19:24,130
If it can make her live with a smile on her face...

358
00:19:24,130 --> 00:19:26,430
I'll give you my life!

359
00:19:26,430 --> 00:19:27,680
Kurogane!

360
00:19:29,230 --> 00:19:30,670
Fool.

361
00:19:30,670 --> 00:19:32,800
You don't stand a chance.

362
00:19:33,480 --> 00:19:35,990
Of course I do, idiot.

363
00:19:35,990 --> 00:19:37,810
I already decided...

364
00:19:38,570 --> 00:19:42,440
that I won't forget Himea again!

365
00:19:44,830 --> 00:19:47,330
No!

366
00:20:30,460 --> 00:20:32,790
You did well, for a small fry.

367
00:20:33,600 --> 00:20:36,170
Like you're one to talk.

368
00:20:36,710 --> 00:20:38,390
Taito...

369
00:20:38,390 --> 00:20:39,920
Taito!

370
00:20:40,760 --> 00:20:42,620
Oh, sorry...

371
00:20:42,620 --> 00:20:44,760
Seems like I made you cry again.

372
00:20:44,760 --> 00:20:47,300
Morning!

373
00:20:48,850 --> 00:20:51,930
Hey, wake up!

374
00:20:52,310 --> 00:20:54,890
Huh? I'm alive?

375
00:20:56,690 --> 00:20:58,320
Still dozing?

376
00:20:58,320 --> 00:20:59,980
Oh? Who's that?

377
00:20:59,980 --> 00:21:01,780
They say it's a transfer student.

378
00:21:07,500 --> 00:21:08,610
Hi-Himea?!

379
00:21:09,330 --> 00:21:10,290
Taito!

380
00:21:11,700 --> 00:21:14,160
I missed you!

381
00:21:16,800 --> 00:21:18,150
Ouch!

382
00:21:18,150 --> 00:21:20,460
I-It wasn't a dream?

383
00:21:20,460 --> 00:21:23,420
T-Then why am I...?

384
00:21:23,970 --> 00:21:25,650
I missed you.

385
00:21:25,650 --> 00:21:27,340
I missed you so much.

386
00:21:29,300 --> 00:21:30,760
No way!

387
00:21:33,000 --> 00:21:34,840
T-Taito?

388
00:21:38,110 --> 00:21:41,320
Kurenai Gekkou?

389
00:21:41,320 --> 00:21:44,070
Student Council

390
00:21:44,260 --> 00:21:47,270
From today on, you're my slaves.

391
00:21:47,600 --> 00:21:50,150
I'll have you working in my student council.

392
00:21:50,150 --> 00:21:51,830
Who are you calling a slave?!

393
00:21:52,100 --> 00:21:54,400
You're a trashy slave.

394
00:21:54,400 --> 00:21:56,080
Or what did you think?

395
00:21:56,080 --> 00:21:58,120
Want me to beat it into your thick head?

396
00:21:58,120 --> 00:21:59,900
Oh, try me.

397
00:21:59,900 --> 00:22:02,380
We'll settle yesterday's...

398
00:22:02,380 --> 00:22:05,020
Hey Himea, could you let go already?

399
00:22:05,020 --> 00:22:06,510
Nope.

400
00:22:06,510 --> 00:22:07,340
Nope?

401
00:22:07,560 --> 00:22:10,140
I'll be together with you forever, Taito!

402
00:22:10,140 --> 00:22:12,350
I'm looking forward to it!

403
00:22:13,440 --> 00:22:14,880
Himea...

404
00:22:15,770 --> 00:22:17,980
That's all. Get lost.

405
00:22:17,980 --> 00:22:20,300
Don't go deciding things on your own!

406
00:22:20,300 --> 00:22:24,600
I have no intention of serving you!

407
00:22:27,600 --> 00:22:30,610
This was the beginning of everything.

408
00:22:31,100 --> 00:22:38,930
The beginning of this bothersome story of how our worlds connected.

